  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<p><b>Ever-changing world</b><br>\nIn Svarog’s Dream, you will have absolute freedom to explore the world and make decisions.</p>\n<p>However, freedom comes with consequences; over time, your actions will shape the world around you, either for the better or worse.</p>\n<p><b>Soul lost between worlds</b><br>\nYou start as a lost soul, and you will inhabit human hosts who are desperate enough to accept you. With each death, you will revisit the underworld and return through new characters with their unique backgrounds and talents.</p>\n<p><b>A pawn in the game of Gods</b><br>\nWhile humans are waging their wars on Earth, the Gods are battling each other in the sky.</p>\n<p>Their power is immense; however, everyone is bound to the threads of destiny, except for you.</p>\n<p>You possess a valuable power—the power of free will—and because of that, the gods will see you as an important piece and will try to persuade you to join their side.</p>\n<p><b>Immersive gameplay</b><br>\nIn Svarog’s Dream, you will discover over a hundred quests, more than a hundred unique abilities, and over five hundred unique items.</p>\n<p>You will have to eat, cook, sleep, craft potions, upgrade gear, buy houses, take loans, and even evade debt collectors or headhunters, and much more.</p>\n<p>We have done our best to make the world around you feel alive and responsive to your decisions.</p>\n",
